{"id":"db6d362dffc421c3","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-filter2-finer-filter.md","title":"ZFC Filter2 Finer Filter","display":"df-zfc-filter2-finer-filter — ZFC Filter2 Finer Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter2-finer-filter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter2-finer-filter","58-df-zfc-filter6-finer-filter"],"display":"df-zfc-filter2-finer-filter — ZFC Filter2 Finer Filter","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-filter-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter2-finer-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter2-finer-filter</span><span>58-df-zfc-filter6-finer-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter2-finer-filter — ZFC Filter2 Finer Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" href=\"?note=5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" title=\"58-df-filter-set\">58-df-filter-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> (underlying set for the filters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> (filter candidates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\)</span> (proper set-filter predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" href=\"?note=5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" title=\"58-df-filter-set\">58-df-filter-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2FinerFilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2FinerFilter}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FinerFilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FinerFilter}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}finer\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2FinerFilter}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal G,X)\\land\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal F\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}finer\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2FinerFilter}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal G,X)\\land\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}finer\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FinerFilter}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2FinerFilter}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}finer\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FinerFilter}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2FinerFilter}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both families use the canonical two-place filter-on-a-set predicate, which excludes the improper filter containing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\">\\(\\varnothing\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span> is finer than <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G\">\\(\\mathcal G\\)</span> exactly when it contains every member of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G\">\\(\\mathcal G\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-filter6-finer-filter</code> is retained as an alias with the same argument order and direction.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-filter-set","status":"resolved","id":"5a7d94a7a7f8209a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-filter-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-filter-set","status":"resolved","id":"5a7d94a7a7f8209a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Filter}_S$ (proper set-filter predicate; see [[58-df-filter-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2FinerFilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FinerFilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}finer\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2FinerFilter}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal G,X)\\land\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal F","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}finer\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FinerFilter}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2FinerFilter}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G)","display":true},{"tex":"\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal G","display":false}],"bytes":1520,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1891","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-filter2-finer-filter.md|58-df-zfc-filter2-finer-filter]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5a7d94a7a7f8209a"]}